This plugin lists trending German Twitter topics on your Wordpress blog.

== Description ==

This plugin lists trending German Twitter topics on your Wordpress blog.

== Installation ==

1. Upload `trends.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Create a directory in 'wp-content' called 'cache' and make it writeable
4. Place the following code in your templates:
   `
  if (function_exists('printTwitterTrends')) php printTwitterTrends(); 
   `
5. OR Use the widget menu in your Wordpress backend 

